# anchors.src - where WordNet meets the hand-built concept base.
#   lemma | pos | sense rank | our gloss
# An imported word's "kind of" chain is followed up WordNet until it
# reaches one of these senses; that concept becomes the parent and the
# chain stops. Anchors are exact senses, never word matches.
# --- tops ---
entity|n|1|thing
physical entity|n|1|thing
object|n|1|thing
organism|n|1|living
animal|n|1|animal
person|n|1|person
doer|n|1|person
female|n|2|female-person
male|n|2|male-person
establishment|n|4|building
crime|n|1|crime
steal|v|1|steal-crime
plant|n|2|plant
body part|n|1|body-part
location|n|1|place
event|n|1|event
act|n|2|event
# --- concepts we already have ---
dog|n|1|dog
squirrel|n|1|squirrel
tree|n|1|tree
leaf|n|1|leaf
flower|n|1|flower
bee|n|1|bee
worm|n|1|worm
water|n|1|water
fence|n|1|fence
nose|n|1|nose
mouth|n|1|mouth
ear|n|1|ear
eye|n|1|eye
leg|n|1|leg
paw|n|1|paw
tail|n|1|tail
house|n|1|house
door|n|1|door
branch|n|2|branch
nut|n|1|nut
# --- verbs: only senses whose rules are right for them ---
travel|v|1|move
perceive|v|1|see
eat|v|1|eat
drink|v|1|drink
stand|v|1|posture
communicate|v|2|say
sit|v|1|sit
# --- adjective slots: the noun an adjective's attribute link points at ---
color|n|1|colour
size|n|1|size
temperature|n|1|temperature
texture|n|1|texture
age|n|1|age
aircraft|n|1|aircraft
